WEBVTT

00:11:59.434 --> 00:12:02.893
You go up to the "File" menu
and you choose "New."

00:12:02.917 --> 00:12:05.116
Now, what happens when you choose "New?"

00:12:05.140 --> 00:12:07.169
Do you get a new blank document?

00:12:07.193 --> 00:12:08.384
You do not.

00:12:08.408 --> 00:12:13.099
On the opposite side of the monitor,
a task bar appears,

00:12:13.123 --> 00:12:16.885
and somewhere in those links --
by the way, not at the top --

00:12:16.909 --> 00:12:21.353
somewhere in those links is a button
that makes you a new document.

00:12:21.377 --> 00:12:24.370
Ok, so that is a company
not counting taps.

00:12:24.394 --> 00:12:28.198
You know, I don't want to just stand
here and make fun of Microsoft ...

00:12:28.222 --> 00:12:29.524
Yes, I do.

00:12:29.548 --> 00:12:30.976
(Laughter)